      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "<div class=\"description\">\n<div style=\"background:var(--background-color-neutral, #eaecf0); color:inherit; font-size:86%; direction:ltr;\">For documentary purposes the German Federal Archive often retained the <b>original image captions</b>, which may be <b>erroneous, biased, obsolete or politically extreme</b>. <abbr class=\"BArchtooltips\" title=\"Files from the inventories “Bild 101 Propagandakompanien der Wehrmacht” and “Bild 183 ADN” may have particularly biased or politically extreme descriptions.\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Info_non-talk.svg/20px-Info_non-talk.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Info_non-talk.svg/40px-Info_non-talk.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"62\" data-file-height=\"62\"></span></span></abbr></div><div class=\"language de\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Germany.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Germany\"><img alt=\"Germany\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Flag_of_Germany.svg/40px-Flag_of_Germany.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Flag_of_Germany.svg/60px-Flag_of_Germany.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"600\"></a></span> <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Deutschland\" title=\"Deutschland\"><span title=\"country in Central Europe\">Germany</span></a> Zentralbild/Kohls/Leske<br>\n<p>29.10.1960<br>\nLeipzig: XIV. Schacholympiade 1960<br>\nIm Ringmessehaus in Leipzig wird vom 16.10. bis 9.11.1960 die XIV. Schacholympiade ausgetragen. Am 28.10. begannen die Finalturniere.<br>\nUBZ Fischer (USA) beobachtet das Spiel von Lombardy (USA) gegen Radovici (Rumänien).<br>\n76 052/53N<br>\n</p>\n<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_States.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1235\" data-file-height=\"650\"></a></span> <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><span title=\"country located primarily in North America\">United States</span></a> Central image / Kohls / Leske<br> Nov. 1, 1960<br> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/14th_Chess_Olympiad\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:14th Chess Olympiad\">w:14th Chess Olympiad</a>, 1960 in Leipzig <br> In the tournament in Leipzig took place between October 26(16?) and November 9, 1960. On Oct. 28, 1960 the final round began.<br> Shown here: Fischer (USA) watches the game of Lombardy (USA) v Radovici (Romania).</div></div>",
        "source": "commons-desc-page"
      },
